{{!
    @template local_coursegen/local/courseai/compact_composer

    Compact composer shown at the bottom of the planning chat column, used to
    send adjustments and regenerate the plan. It reuses the chips row and the
    "+" options toolbar of the main composer (composer_chips and
    composer_toolbar partials) rendered in their compact variant, so the
    compact element ids come from the same source as the main ones.

    The card starts hidden with an inline display style unless the page resumes
    a session: the JavaScript toggles element.style.display on the card, the
    chips row and the stop/resume buttons (migrated in a later step).

    Classes required for JS:
    * none (elements are addressed by id)

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * see local_coursegen/local/courseai/composer_chips and composer_toolbar

    Context variables required for this template:
    * isresuming bool - True when the page resumes an existing session
    * compactcomposer object - Carries {"compact": true} so the shared chips and
      toolbar partials render their compact instance ids
    * subsectionsenabled bool - Render the "with subsections" toggle
    * guidelinelist object - Context of local_coursegen/local/courseai/guideline_list_compact

    Example context (json):
    {
        "isresuming": false,
        "compactcomposer": {"compact": true},
        "subsectionsenabled": true,
        "guidelinelist": {
            "listlabel": "Guidelines list",
            "emptytext": "No results",
            "hasitems": false,
            "items": []
        }
    }
}}
<div class="compact-chat-card" id="compactChatCard"{{^isresuming}} style="display:none"{{/isresuming}}>
  <textarea
    id="compactPromptInput"
    class="compact-prompt-textarea"
    placeholder="{{#str}}courseai_compact_prompt_placeholder, local_coursegen{{/str}}"
    rows="3"
    aria-label="{{#str}}courseai_prompt_arialabel, local_coursegen{{/str}}"
  ></textarea>

  {{#compactcomposer}}{{> local_coursegen/local/courseai/composer_chips }}{{/compactcomposer}}

  <div class="compact-chat-toolbar">
    <div class="compact-toolbar-left" id="compactToolbarLeft">
      {{#compactcomposer}}{{> local_coursegen/local/courseai/composer_toolbar }}{{/compactcomposer}}
    </div>

    <div class="compact-toolbar-right">
      <button class="btn-compact-regenerate" id="btnCompactRegenerate" type="button" aria-label="{{#str}}courseai_btn_regenerate, local_coursegen{{/str}}" title="{{#str}}courseai_btn_regenerate, local_coursegen{{/str}}">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M12 19V5M5 12l7-7 7 7"/>
        </svg>
      </button>
      <button class="btn-stop-resume btn-stop" id="btnStopExec" type="button"
              style="display:none"
              aria-label="{{#str}}courseai_btn_stop, local_coursegen{{/str}}"
              title="{{#str}}courseai_btn_stop, local_coursegen{{/str}}">
        {{#str}}courseai_btn_stop, local_coursegen{{/str}}
      </button>
      <button class="btn-stop-resume btn-resume" id="btnResumeExec" type="button"
              style="display:none"
              aria-label="{{#str}}courseai_btn_resume, local_coursegen{{/str}}"
              title="{{#str}}courseai_btn_resume, local_coursegen{{/str}}">
        {{#str}}courseai_btn_resume, local_coursegen{{/str}}
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
